# FOREWORD

- This Qualification Standard (QS) for Cyber Operators (Cyber Op) is issued on the authority of the Commander of Military Personnel Generation Training Group (MPGTG).

- This QS is based upon the Rank Qualification (RQ) (XXXX) for Cyber Op MOSID 00378 found in Cyber Op Occupation Specification (Ref A01) dated 29-09-2017.

- This QS was developed in collaboration with representatives from:

- Canadian Forces Network Operations Centre (CFNOC);

- Cyber Training Unit (CTU);

- Directorate of Cyber Operations Force Development (DCOFD);

- 34 Signal Regiment (34 Sigs Reg); and

- CAF Cyber Command HQ.

- It was prepared in accordance with (IAW) the concept of training outlined in the A-P9-050 Series, Canadian Forces Manuals of Individual Training and Education.

- This publication is effective upon receipt.

- Suggestions for secretarial amendments or review shall be actioned IAW Formation Standing Orders (FSO) 1104B.

