| **L****ocation of Board** | JIIFC classroom, CFS Leitrim |
| **Dates** | 12 -16 Aug 24 |
| **Version** |  |
|  |
| **Board Composition** | **Surname** | **Initials** | **Rank** | **Unit** |
| Co-Chair (content) | Kim | KM | Capt | CTU |
| Co-Chair (process) | Gosselin | C | Capt | CTU |
| SME | Croft | CMJ | Sgt | CTU |
