| SME | Yao | A | MCpl | 34 Sig Regt |
| SME | Gallo | JF | MCpl | 34 Sig Regt |
| SME | Morrison | BG | WO | CFNOC |
| SME | Herlihy | DJ | Cpl | CFNOC |
